{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他带着对那种生活的牵挂继续往前，反倒觉得它近了些。\",\n      \"key\": \"它近了些\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他从前总想退回心里的安宁来护住那种生活，可光退回来，妨碍它的事仍会继续。\",\n      \"key\": \"妨碍它的事\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他惦记着自己想护住的生活，也继续做眼前的事，因为想护住它正是他行动的理由。\",\n      \"key\": \"行动的理由\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他知道拼命未必换回那种生活，若把累当软弱硬撑，反会磨掉他想留住的亲近。\",\n      \"key\": \"想留住的亲近\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"text\": \"怀疑和疲惫过后，他想起曾有的安宁仍会高兴，心里稍稍松下来，可那种生活还没回来，能护住多少仍没把握。\",\n      \"key\": \"曾有的安宁\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-6\",\n      \"text\": \"他知道自己还会累，真要付出代价时，也可能又想退回安宁。\",\n      \"key\": \"退回安宁\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-7\",\n      \"text\": \"他不再靠拼命证明自己该往前，仍清楚自己想护住什么。\",\n      \"key\": \"想护住什么\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B4\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"失效\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-6\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-7\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-7\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R65\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留带着牵挂行动后旧愿反而更近的变化，直接说出他此刻的感受。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R66\", \"R67\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"把过去想退回安宁保护旧愿的打算，与退回去也挡不住现实难处放在一起，删去重复的行动宣言。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R68\", \"R70\", \"R71\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并具体化\",\n      \"why\": \"保留旧愿成为行动理由、两种心意共同推动他的关键变化。通过他一边惦记、一边做事，写出依恋不再是行动的拖累，也没有被责任压下去。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R69\", \"R76\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并具体化\",\n      \"why\": \"保留努力未必实现愿望、硬撑可能磨损所爱这两层意思。把抽象的坚持原则和价值判断改成他实际担心付出会损伤什么。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R72\", \"R73\", \"R75\", \"R77\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"保留旧日安宁重新带来快乐、愿望仍未实现、最后能护住多少仍无把握。让他对过去的真实感受与对现实的担忧同时成立，不再用抽象的两边对照作总结。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R74\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-6\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留未来疲惫、面对代价时可能动摇的风险，用具体的退回安宁的念头代替关于两种渴望仍有冲突的概括。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R78\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-7\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他不再反复证明自己才肯向前的变化，并让结尾落在不靠拼命仍清楚自己想护住什么上，补足末尾收束与高音显现的心理原因。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "47c1b33c-b824-49ff-b0fb-dffdf5cff45a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T211901214543Z", "elapsed_seconds": 575.812, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T21:28:37.052206+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2b7b3dcafceafb88c849a61b918a992caa629b82388f2603fc1ee28cda86dfcf", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T211901214543Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "81ceb185e9e64f236d2485f12f312e94da87ffb0a42c0f57705a9406519f6b87"}}}
